        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCLYO19, 1920's Black Glass Lyon Knob with Arched Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Lyon Black Glass Knob with Arc Plate has a 1920's retro feel that makes this knobset with extra big escutcheon a must have for historic buildings. The Arc Tall Plate is 11 inches x 2-1/2 inches so it will be sure to stand out, even on larger doors. The 1920's Black Glass Lyon Knob with Arched Plate is available in your choice of finish for the brass rosette, all of which really make the black color of the Lyon Knob stand out in a striking way. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/black-lyon-knob-with-arc-tall-plate-entryset-grandeur-arclyo19entr\"><b> Lyon Knob with Arc Tall Plate Keyed Entry</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Lyon Knob with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Black Glass Lyon Knob with Arched Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.11\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCLYO19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262364\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCLYO19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Lyon Black Glass Knob with Arc Plate",
                "description": "The Lyon Black Glass Knob with Arc Plate has a 1920's retro feel that makes this knobset with extra big escutcheon a must have for historic buildings. The Arc Tall Plate is 11 inches x 2-1/2 inches so it will be sure to stand out, even on larger doors. The 1920's Black Glass Lyon Knob with Arched Plate is available in your choice of finish for the brass rosette, all of which really make the black color of the Lyon Knob stand out in a striking way. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.  Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. ",
                "keywords": "Lyon Knob with Arc Tall Plates, Lyon Black Glass Knob with Arc Plates, Black Glass Lyon Knob with Arched Plates, Grandeur Lyon Knob with Arched Roses, 1920's Black Glass Lyon Knob with Arched Plates, Grandeur ARCLYO19 single dummy Knobs, Grandeur ARCLYO24 double dummy Knobs, Grandeur ARCLYO12 passage Knobs, Grandeur ARCLYO42 privacy Knobs, GRA-ARCLYO19, Grandeur ARCLYO82 keyed entry Knobs,"
